      "rawText": "<story>庭上只讨论已经提交的材料。樱羽艾玛提到「停业通知书」。</story>\n<phone_messages>[]</phone_messages>\n<world_actions>[{\"type\":\"court_step\",\"key\":\"testimony-1\",\"kind\":\"testimony\",\"summary\":\"当事人确认了停业通知书的内容。\"}]</world_actions>"
